# caddy/.env.example
# Caddy has no secrets managed via .env. TLS certificates, reverse proxy rules,
# and domain configuration are all defined in your Caddyfile.
#
# No .env file is required for this service.
# Update TZ and host.docker.internal IP directly in compose.yaml.
# Place your Caddyfile at: /opt/stacks/caddy/Caddyfile
#
# Caddy documentation: https://caddyserver.com/docs/caddyfile
